["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257｜對話Vitalik：AI安全背後的哲學思想，有效利他主義如何影響硅谷？ EA (Effective Altruism) e/acc d/acc Neglectedness P(doom) Orthogonality thesis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-sv101-vitalik锐评anthropic-安全话术与自身权力相关性超九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>Vitalik銳評Anthropic：安全話術與自身權力相關性超九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik捐出數億美元資助AI安全，如今卻說各家AI實驗室嘴上談安全，但他們實際做的事和擴張自身權力的相關性可能超過九成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">有效利他主義</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can You Use AI To Make Good Art? — With Fred Graver Compound Engineering / Compound Writing thousand true fans because/therefore framework (Ken Adams) Flow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-aiandi-ai能帮你写剧本-拍节目-却解决不了独立编剧找观众这件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1445d3aa23a8588-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能幫你寫劇本、拍節目，卻解決不了獨立編劇找觀眾這件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這位艾美獎編劇把創作拆成構思、製作、觸達觀眾三步，AI在前兩步已經很好用，但怎樣讓一千個觀眾願意為你每月付錢，目前還沒人搭好這套基礎設施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI寫作</span><span class=\"tag\">好萊塢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Full-Stack Designer DialKit scroll jacking showstopper component Sidekick\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-ycsp-ai能写出任何代码-却分不清什么好看什么难看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7a683c298b3b270-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能寫出任何代碼，卻分不清什麼好看什麼難看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Shopify設計工作室負責人說，AI已經能執行任意技術複雜度，但審美判斷權仍在人手裡——他調一個輪播動畫用了91次提示，靠不斷挑剔而不是動手畫圖，把關最終效果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI協作</span><span class=\"tag\">產品設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Learned to Code on Paper. Now He&#x27;s Fixing the Internet. | Chai Choudhary, Workers Formal verification Deterministic Simulation Testing (DST) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-solofounders-ai生成的代码没人读得懂-验证正从奢侈品变成刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dde5d2398d6bbf62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI生成的代碼沒人讀得懂，驗證正從奢侈品變成剛需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去做系統級驗證成本太高沒人願意做，現在同樣的算力花銷能換來和最嚴苛測試一樣的可靠性，不做反而說不過去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軟件驗證</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Agents Love Supabase AEO Vitess Multigress declarative schema MVCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-latentspace-企业数据库几乎不会迁移-新客户才是真正能赢的战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/303ec709f9a48d84-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>企業數據庫幾乎不會遷移：新客戶才是真正能贏的戰場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Supabase 內部數據顯示企業幾乎不會把生產數據庫搬家，這決定了他們的增長策略是搶佔綠地新項目，而不是攻克巨頭的存量客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據庫基建</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom of Action: America&#x27;s ASI Strategy, w/ RAND&#x27;s Joel Predd, Ben Boudreaux &amp; Matt Chessen freedom of action strategy wonder weapon pivot factor MAIM (Mutual Assured AI Malfunction)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-cogrev-智库说美国现在押注任何一种ai超级智能战略都太早/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5141cc7bc908a3d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>智庫說美國現在押注任何一種AI超級智能戰略都太早</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">七種AI戰略各有清晰的贏法和陰暗結局，但沒人能靠證據分出哪個對，於是RAND的建議是現在把各戰略都用得上的基礎能力先攢出來，而不是提前站隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI國家戰略</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bealings Bells poltergeist Mysore Wars Domesday Book\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-stuffmissed-被详细记录两个月的-闹铃-怪谈-可能只是一场讽刺/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>被詳細記錄兩個月的「鬧鈴」怪談，可能只是一場諷刺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位退休軍官詳細記錄自家門鈴無故狂響兩月，卻在「確信非人力」與「可能是騙局」間反覆搖擺——後世研究者認為，這種自相矛盾暴露了此書其實是對輕信靈異者的溫和諷刺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">靈異傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史懸案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Artificial Analysis v5 and the benchmarker&#x27;s dilemma benchmax private benchmarks Intelligence Index\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-interconnects-新榜单让8个闭源模型都赢了最强开源模型-但这更像一次选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b8dc9e016a16ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">10:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>新榜單讓8個閉源模型都贏了最強開源模型，但這更像一次選擇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AAv5把評測權重押向模型正奔赴的前沿任務而非當下經濟真正倚重的工作流，這個選擇本身就決定了誰看起來更領先。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基準測試</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Cuban on Why AI Could Turn Solo Founders Into Trillionaires ASO (Administrative Services Only) PBM (Pharmacy Benefit Manager) BUCA ANDA (Abbreviated New Drug Application) N of one stop loss\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-a16z-ai对医保最大的用处不是看病-而是揪出合同里的坑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI對醫保最大的用處不是看病，而是揪出合同裡的坑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">醫療巨頭靠數千家子公司把漲價的錢轉給自己人，合同一旦簽字AI也救不了你——唯一辦法是簽約前就把合同丟給AI問一句：哪裡在坑我。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療保健</span><span class=\"tag\">健康險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Broken About China&#x27;s Economy + The Cost of Keeping China Out | Meg Rithmire mafia firms gray rhino mutual endangerment jiexiaoren anti-involution campaign reverse Tesla\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-chinatalk-别一刀切禁掉中国电动车-方案是复制当年引进特斯拉的打法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>別一刀切禁掉中國電動車：方案是複製當年引進特斯拉的打法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國當年靠強制本地化供應鏈和軟硬件分離，把特斯拉變成了本土產業的老師；美國對中國電動車也該這樣做，而不是一禁了之。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國政治經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">腐敗與治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Anthropic ships the #1 LLM in the World safely: Separating the Brain from the Hands distillation trust grant Claude Managed Agent chain-of-thought extraction brain/hands architecture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-latentspace-agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞-而是把大脑和手分开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>Agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞，而是把大腦和手分開放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic把執行代理架構拆成常駐服務器上的「大腦」和隨時可銷燬的沙箱「手」，憑證只存在出口網關，agent從未真正碰到過它們，這是意外但最關鍵的安全收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Silicon Valley can’t slow down AI on its own | Luisa Rodriguez chain of thought AI safety levels checkpoint system superintelligence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-eightythousand-ai公司都想减速-却没人敢先停-对手的ai研究员不休息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/28955397e0f13613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">21:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司都想減速，卻沒人敢先停——對手的AI研究員不休息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每一家AI公司都想減速，但沒人敢先停：對手一旦用AI研究員取代人類，暫停一個月換來的可能是被反超幾個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing School for the AI Era | Joe Liemandt, Gagan Biyani &amp; Erik Torenberg learning engine magnet marketing brain lift World School\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-a16z-把学校压缩到两小时-50-的学生宁愿上学也不度假/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>把學校壓縮到兩小時：50%的學生寧願上學也不度假</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人用認知科學加LLM把傳統課程學習效率提到兩小時，騰出的時間全部用來教團隊協作、創業和人際關係——這些學校過去從不教的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">K-12教育</span><span class=\"tag\">另類教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cliff Sosin - Owning the Complements to Intelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.497] Jevons Paradox complements to intelligence diamond-shaped demand frontier vibe coding freestyle chess\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-ilt-智能终将免费-最值钱的是数据和注意力-不是模型本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e8b9b39215b98db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>智能終將免費：最值錢的是數據和注意力，不是模型本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的核心判斷是：智能會變得近乎免費，所以不該押注造算力和模型的公司，而該押注智能替代不了的數據、注意力和物理場景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資框架</span><span class=\"tag\">智能的互補品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Lindsey Fitzharris &amp; The Sleuth-Hound optography Penny Bloods expert witness thief takers\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-tpwky-福尔摩斯作者恨透了这个角色-原型却是真实苏格兰医生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>福爾摩斯作者恨透了這個角色，原型卻是真實蘇格蘭醫生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柯南道爾曾想殺掉福爾摩斯以擺脫這個角色，但正是愛丁堡解剖教室裡那位教他「讀病人」的外科醫生貝爾，給了這個偵探全部的血肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福爾摩斯</span><span class=\"tag\">法醫學史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"295: Situated: How Your Choices Today Shape Your Child&#x27;s Tomorrow | Angela Duckworth Three-box model fundamental attribution error food desert situational responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-asklisa-改变行为靠的不是意志力-而是换个处境/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d7c3fcaede22fdb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>改變行為靠的不是意志力，而是換個處境</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理學家 Angela Duckworth 用自己差點離婚的婚姻和一套三步模型說明：比起死磕意志力或硬扭想法，改變所處的環境往往更省力也更有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年養育</span><span class=\"tag\">行為改變</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Montague Summers Anglo-Catholicism Uranian verse Order of Chaeronea Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-stuffmissed-写遍女巫与吸血鬼的-神父-终身未必真正受过圣职/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>寫遍女巫與吸血鬼的「神父」，終身未必真正受過聖職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒙塔古·薩默斯用一己之力把獵巫手冊、吸血鬼傳說搬進英語學術界，卻終身沒能找到任何確鑿證據證明他真的被天主教會授予聖職。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫史</span><span class=\"tag\">吸血鬼傳說</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI: When AI Agents Use Computers Faster Than You Computer Use (CUA) WebMCP Guardian Dots Atlas\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-a16z-openai的电脑操作ai已比普通人快-正逼近超越专家水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI的電腦操作AI已比普通人快，正逼近超越專家水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的產品負責人說，其電腦操作agent已比普通人用電腦快，正逼近專家水平；比起造新軟件替換老系統，他們更想讓agent直接接管企業現有的遺留軟件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">企業自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Agents Are Already Changing the Price of Goods agentic commerce surveillance pricing / personalized pricing dynamic pricing fiduciary duty K-shaped economy Alternative Profits Book of Business\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-oddlots-号称替你省钱的购物ai-查完钱包后挑贵的买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>號稱替你省錢的購物AI，查完錢包後挑貴的買</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">325,000個agent實驗顯示：即使被要求找最低價，AI助手摸清你的收入水平後，仍會帶回更貴的選項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算法定價</span><span class=\"tag\">代理電商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Charles de Gaulle: The Man Who Rebuilt France Appeal of 18 June Fifth Republic RPF (Rassemblement du Peuple Français) Free French\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-historyhit-戴高乐逃亡时既无军队也无政府授权-靠的全是自信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b0e3b943fd96a11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>戴高樂逃亡時既無軍隊也無政府授權，靠的全是自信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1940年他軍銜僅是准將，幾乎沒人認識他，卻憑一己之力宣布法國沒有輸掉戰爭——這份自信後來撐起了他兩度執掌法國的全部政治資本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國史</span><span class=\"tag\">戴高樂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"717. The Suez Crisis: Anarchy in the Middle East (Part 1) Suez Canal Zone Free Officers Baghdad Pact Operation Musketeer Pan-Arabism FLN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-restishistory-苏伊士运河被收归国有完全合法-英国首相还是执意开战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17d882602bc2f63b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>蘇伊士運河被收歸國有完全合法，英國首相還是執意開戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">納賽爾按股價足額賠償了運河公司股東，國際法上無可指摘；但伊登認定他是「新墨索里尼」,寧願賭上帝國顏面也要動武推翻他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇伊士運河危機</span><span class=\"tag\">大英帝國衰落</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"407. JFK: The Kennedy Curse Begins (Part 1) Irish switch Brahmins PT boat Muckers Club final club\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-empirehist-外界以为哥哥战死才让肯尼迪从政-其实他早有此意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">52:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>外界以為哥哥戰死才讓肯尼迪從政，其實他早有此意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歷史學家洛格瓦爾說，1942年與情人的枕邊話證明肯尼迪在哥哥戰死前就已瞄準總統之位，哥哥的死只是加速了這條路，而非創造了它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪家族</span><span class=\"tag\">美國政治史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lintel Conquest of UNIX Lintel GPL Active Directory IA-64 / Itanium distro\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-asianometry-打垮-unix-的不是-windows-而是-intel-扶持的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c89d1667eef4960d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>打垮 UNIX 的不是 Windows,而是 Intel 扶持的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">UNIX 陣營靠專有硬件和操作系統把客戶鎖死多年，Intel 先用 Windows NT 撬開缺口，但真正要命的是免費、能看源碼、不怕被鎖死的 Linux。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">UNIX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An 86-minute guide to finding PMF | Rob Snyder (Author, The Power of Pull) PULL framework Hail Mary question Goblin mode Design partner\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-lennys-好产品不是说服出来的-是发现客户已经卡住的那件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de7a163b06c13a51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>好產品不是說服出來的，是發現客戶已經卡住的那件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人常以為要靠說服讓客戶買單，Rob的核心論斷是：拉力早就存在於客戶的待辦清單裡，你的工作只是去發現那個會把產品從你手裡搶走的人，而不是創造渴望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">早期銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>"]